#: kio_smb_auth.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Please enter authentication information for:\n"
"Server = %1\n"
"Share = %2"
msgstr ""
"Prošu zapodajće awtentifikacisku informaciju za:\n"
"Serwer=%1\n"
"Share=%2"

#: kio_smb_auth.cpp:156
msgid "libsmbclient failed to initialize"
msgstr "Njemóžach libsmbclient initializować"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:64
msgid ""
"%1:\n"
"Unknown file type, neither directory or file."
msgstr ""
"%1:\n"
"Njeznata družina datajow, ani zapisk ani dataja."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:123
#, c-format
msgid "File does not exist: %1"
msgstr "Dataja njeeksistuje: %1"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:238
msgid "Unable to find any workgroups in your local network."
msgstr "Njemóžach žane dźěłowe skupiny we wašej lokalnej syći namakać."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:256
msgid "Share could not be found on given server"
msgstr "Share so na zapodatym serwerje njehodźi namakać"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:259
msgid "BAD File descriptor"
msgstr "Hubjeny datajowy deskriptor"

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:262
msgid ""
"libsmbclient reported an error, but didn't specify what the problem is. This "
"might indicate a severe problem with your network - but also might indicate "
"a problem with libsmbclient.\n"
"If you want to help us, please provide a tcpdump of the network interface "
"while you try to browse (be aware that it might contain private data, so "
"don't post it if you're unsure about that - you can send it privately to the "
"developers if they ask for it)"
msgstr ""
"libsmbclient je zmylk signalizował bjez informacije wo zmylku. "
"To je indic za problem pak z wašej syću pak z libsmbclient.\n"
"Jeli chceće nam pomhać, prošu pósćelće nam tcpdump syćoweho interfejsa při browsowanju (tam móhli so priwatne daty chować, tuž je njesćelće na zjawne městno, jeli sej njejsće wěsći -- móžeće je priwatnje wuwiwarjam pósłać, hdyž so za tym prašeja)."

#: kio_smb_browse.cpp:273
#, c-format
msgid "Unknown error condition in stat: %1"
msgstr "Njeznaty zmylk w stawje: %1"

#: kio_smb_mount.cpp:75
msgid ""
"\n"
"Make sure that the samba package is installed properly on your system."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Přepruwujće, hač je pakćik 'samba' korektnje instalowany."

